# Device-QA screenshots. `scripts/device-qa.sh` MOVES Maestro's PNGs out of the repo root
# into ~/Pictures/screenshots/nudge/qa-<ts>/, but a run killed mid-flow leaves them here,
# where the next `git add -A` would sweep them into an unrelated commit.
/[0-9][0-9]-*.png
